  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the cell</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>atm</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>Pt</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>When the potential of the cell is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>712</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>/</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></math> is<br />(Nearest integer)<br />Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"right\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></menclose><mi>Pt</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>",
