  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given cell reaction:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></msub><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>atm</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>aq</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>Pt</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>at anode(oxidation)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>At cathode(reduction) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Fe</mi><mi>aq</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msubsup><mi>Fe</mi><mi>aq</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mo>&#176;</mo><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cathode</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>anode</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>|</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Thus, using Nernst equation,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>712</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>771</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"box\"><mfrac><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></menclose></math></p>",
